<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>积云 · 逐像素对比 R03</title><style>
:root{font:14px/1.6 "Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#0c1721;color:#d7e8f1;--line:#314b5d;--muted:#8eaabc;--cyan:#8dd2eb}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:1600px;margin:auto;padding:28px 32px 55px}a{color:var(--cyan)}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:550;margin:5px 0}h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:550}p{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin:5px 0 18px}.eyebrow{font:10px Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--cyan)}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:12px 20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#152734;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px 8px 0 0}label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px}select,button{font:inherit;font-size:12px;color:#dcecf4;border:1px solid #49677b;border-radius:5px;padding:6px 9px;background:#1c3445;cursor:pointer}input{accent-color:#8dd2eb}input[type=range]{width:110px}.viewport{overflow:auto;max-height:660px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#09121b;position:relative}.viewport canvas{display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;cursor:crosshair;touch-action:pan-y}.bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#132532;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:0;padding:9px 14px;font:11px Consolas,monospace;color:#a6c7d9}.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:24px}.panel{background:#13232f;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:20px}.loupes{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.loupe{flex:1;min-width:130px}.loupe canvas{width:100%;max-width:300px;image-rendering:pixelated;border:1px solid #3c5768;background:#081421}.loupe strong{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#a8ccdd;margin-bottom:8px}.rgb{font:12px Consolas,monospace;display:block;margin:6px 0;color:#b8d7e7}.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;font-size:10px;color:#a4bfce}.ramp{width:130px;height:9px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#101829,#7a44aa,#ec6953,#ffe39b)}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px}th,td{text-align:left;padding:10px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #2d4556}th{font-weight:500;color:#83a9bd}td{color:#d2e3ec}td.improved{color:#c4df9b}.note{font-size:11px;line-height:1.9;color:#8faebe}.status{color:#c4df9b;font-size:12px}#error{color:#ffb9a8}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,canvas:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:3px}footer{font-size:11px;color:#7594a6;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px;margin-top:24px}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:12px;margin-top:15px}@media(max-width:800px){main{padding:18px 12px}.panels{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:23px}header{align-items:start}.toolbar{gap:10px}.viewport{max-height:440px}.panel{padding:14px}table{font-size:10px}}
</style></head><body><main>
<header><div><span class="eyebrow">REFERENCE / R01 / R02 / R03 · 2048 × 768</span><h1>云的差距，逐像素看。</h1></div><a href="index.html#cloud">返回 TA 方案 ↗</a></header>
<p>原图与三版云层都使用 2048 × 768、t = 0、固定构图。边界以下沿用原图地景定位，只有上方云区参与对比。鼠标取样，点击锁定，方向键可移动一个原始像素。</p>
<div class="toolbar">
<label>版本<select id="version"><option value="r03">R03 · 四层平涂</option><option value="r02">R02 · 程序云簇</option><option value="r01">R01 · 上一版</option></select></label>
<label>查看<select id="mode"><option value="split">左右拖动对比</option><option value="overlay">透明叠加</option><option value="diff">RGB 绝对差分</option><option value="mask">云轮廓差异</option><option value="reference">只看原图</option><option value="render">只看程序云层</option></select></label>
<label>分界 / 透明度<input id="blend" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label>
<label>画幅<select id="zoom"><option value="fit">适应窗口</option><option value="1">1 : 1 原始像素</option><option value="2">2 ×</option><option value="4">4 ×</option></select></label>
<label><input id="roi" type="checkbox" checked>仅云区差分 / 显示边界</label>
<button id="unlock" type="button">解锁取样</button>
</div>
<div class="viewport" id="viewport"><canvas id="comparison" width="2048" height="768" tabindex="0" aria-label="原图与程序云的像素对齐画布"></canvas></div>
<div class="bar"><span id="status">加载原始像素与同尺寸渲染…</span><span>左：原图 · 右：程序云层</span><span id="position">x = 1536, y = 200</span></div><p id="error" role="alert" hidden></p>
<div class="panels"><section class="panel"><h2>25 × 25 像素局部放大</h2><p>每格对应一个原始像素；方框中心为当前取样点。</p><div class="loupes"><div class="loupe"><strong>REFERENCE / 原图</strong><canvas id="reference-loupe" width="300" height="300"></canvas><span class="rgb" id="reference-rgb"></span></div><div class="loupe"><strong id="render-label">R03 / 四层平涂</strong><canvas id="render-loupe" width="300" height="300"></canvas><span class="rgb" id="render-rgb"></span></div></div><span class="rgb" id="delta"></span><div class="legend"><span>差分低</span><span class="ramp"></span><span>差分高</span></div></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>同一云区的 R01 / R02 / R03 实测</h2><div id="metrics"></div><p class="note">R01 / R02 为纯程序几何；R03 直接复用参考 SVG 轮廓并以四种固定色平涂。云区边界是按原图山脊与前景绘制的固定折线，排除列车、山、水面与树。云/天空分界使用固定 RGB 阈值，因此交并比只是可复现的轮廓近似指标。颜色误差为同一位置的 8-bit RGB 绝对误差，不表示感知相似度；主云顶均差沿 19 个固定横坐标采样，单位是原始像素。没有配准移动图像，也没有自动美化差分。</p><p class="note">轮廓模式：白色＝共同云区，橙色＝原图有云而程序缺失，青色＝程序多出的云。差分模式使用两图云掩膜的并集；天空底色差异可取消“仅云区”查看。</p><div class="actions"><a id="download" download="cloud-pixel-metrics.json">下载指标 JSON</a><a href="examples/scene.html" target="_blank">运行 R03 动画 ↗</a><a href="evidence/r03/render-r03.png" download>下载 2048×768 渲染</a></div></section></div>
<footer>热图将平均通道误差 0–160 映射到色带，≥160 显示最高亮色；RGB 读数与指标保留原始 0–255 数值。像素比较是固定 t=0 的原生渲染快照；运动仍在独立案例中检查。数据由 <code>npm run compare:cloud</code> 重新捕获。R03 采用参考 SVG 的轮廓与四层固定填色，属于参考轮廓驱动的动画；不代表纯程序几何拟合的提升。</footer>
